{"title":"Python Requests 库","slug":"requests","date":"2024-02-26T04:00:00.000Z","updated":"2024-02-26T04:00:00.000Z","comments":true,"path":"api/articles/requests.json","excerpt":null,"covers":null,"content":"<h1 id=\"Python-Requests-库\"><a href=\"#Python-Requests-库\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Python Requests 库\"></a>Python Requests 库</h1><p><code>requests</code> 是 Python 中一个流行的 HTTP 库，用于发送 HTTP 请求并处理响应。它提供了简洁而直观的 API，使得在 Python 中进行 HTTP 通信变得非常容易。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发送-GET-请求\"><a href=\"#发送-GET-请求\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"发送 GET 请求\"></a>发送 GET 请求</h2><p>你可以使用 <code>requests.get()</code> 方法来发送一个 GET 请求，并获取服务器的响应。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/data&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"发送-POST-请求\"><a href=\"#发送-POST-请求\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"发送 POST 请求\"></a>发送 POST 请求</h2><p>发送 POST 请求同样很简单，使用 <code>requests.post()</code> 方法即可。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">data = &#123;<span class=\"string\">&#x27;key&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;value&#x27;</span>&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.post(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/submit&#x27;</span>, data=data)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"添加请求头\"><a href=\"#添加请求头\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"添加请求头\"></a>添加请求头</h2><p>有时候需要在请求中添加一些自定义的头信息，你可以通过 <code>headers</code> 参数实现。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;<span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0&#x27;</span>&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com&#x27;</span>, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"处理响应\"><a href=\"#处理响应\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"处理响应\"></a>处理响应</h2><p><code>response</code> 对象包含了很多信息，例如状态码、响应头和响应体。你可以通过它们来处理服务器的响应。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.status_code)  <span class=\"comment\"># 打印状态码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.headers)      <span class=\"comment\"># 打印响应头</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)         <span class=\"comment\"># 打印响应体的文本内容</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"处理-JSON-响应\"><a href=\"#处理-JSON-响应\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"处理 JSON 响应\"></a>处理 JSON 响应</h2><p>如果服务器返回的是 JSON 格式的数据，你可以直接调用 <code>response.json()</code> 方法来获取解析后的 Python 对象。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/data.json&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">data = response.json()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(data)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"处理异常\"><a href=\"#处理异常\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"处理异常\"></a>处理异常</h2><p>在实际应用中，网络请求可能会失败，因此你需要处理异常情况。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    response.raise_for_status()  <span class=\"comment\"># 如果请求失败，会抛出异常</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">except</span> requests.exceptions.HTTPError <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> err:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(err)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"使用-Session-对象\"><a href=\"#使用-Session-对象\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"使用 Session 对象\"></a>使用 Session 对象</h2><p><code>requests.Session</code> 类提供了一个持久性的会话对象，可以在多个请求之间保持某些参数。这对于维护身份验证信息或者在多个请求之间共享 Cookie 非常有用。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 创建 Session 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">session = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 Session 对象发送请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = session.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/login&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用相同的 Session 对象发送另一个请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = session.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/data&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>以上是关于 <code>requests</code> 库的一些基本知识点。使用这些知识，你可以方便地进行 HTTP 请求和处理服务器响应。</p>\n","more":"<h1 id=\"Python-Requests-库\"><a href=\"#Python-Requests-库\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"Python Requests 库\"></a>Python Requests 库</h1><p><code>requests</code> 是 Python 中一个流行的 HTTP 库，用于发送 HTTP 请求并处理响应。它提供了简洁而直观的 API，使得在 Python 中进行 HTTP 通信变得非常容易。</p>\n<h2 id=\"发送-GET-请求\"><a href=\"#发送-GET-请求\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"发送 GET 请求\"></a>发送 GET 请求</h2><p>你可以使用 <code>requests.get()</code> 方法来发送一个 GET 请求，并获取服务器的响应。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/data&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"发送-POST-请求\"><a href=\"#发送-POST-请求\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"发送 POST 请求\"></a>发送 POST 请求</h2><p>发送 POST 请求同样很简单，使用 <code>requests.post()</code> 方法即可。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">data = &#123;<span class=\"string\">&#x27;key&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;value&#x27;</span>&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.post(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/submit&#x27;</span>, data=data)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"添加请求头\"><a href=\"#添加请求头\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"添加请求头\"></a>添加请求头</h2><p>有时候需要在请求中添加一些自定义的头信息，你可以通过 <code>headers</code> 参数实现。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">headers = &#123;<span class=\"string\">&#x27;User-Agent&#x27;</span>: <span class=\"string\">&#x27;Mozilla/5.0&#x27;</span>&#125;</span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com&#x27;</span>, headers=headers)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"处理响应\"><a href=\"#处理响应\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"处理响应\"></a>处理响应</h2><p><code>response</code> 对象包含了很多信息，例如状态码、响应头和响应体。你可以通过它们来处理服务器的响应。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.status_code)  <span class=\"comment\"># 打印状态码</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.headers)      <span class=\"comment\"># 打印响应头</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(response.text)         <span class=\"comment\"># 打印响应体的文本内容</span></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"处理-JSON-响应\"><a href=\"#处理-JSON-响应\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"处理 JSON 响应\"></a>处理 JSON 响应</h2><p>如果服务器返回的是 JSON 格式的数据，你可以直接调用 <code>response.json()</code> 方法来获取解析后的 Python 对象。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/data.json&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">data = response.json()</span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(data)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"处理异常\"><a href=\"#处理异常\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"处理异常\"></a>处理异常</h2><p>在实际应用中，网络请求可能会失败，因此你需要处理异常情况。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">try</span>:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    response = requests.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\">    response.raise_for_status()  <span class=\"comment\"># 如果请求失败，会抛出异常</span></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">except</span> requests.exceptions.HTTPError <span class=\"keyword\">as</span> err:</span><br><span class=\"line\">    <span class=\"built_in\">print</span>(err)</span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<h2 id=\"使用-Session-对象\"><a href=\"#使用-Session-对象\" class=\"headerlink\" title=\"使用 Session 对象\"></a>使用 Session 对象</h2><p><code>requests.Session</code> 类提供了一个持久性的会话对象，可以在多个请求之间保持某些参数。这对于维护身份验证信息或者在多个请求之间共享 Cookie 非常有用。</p>\n<figure class=\"highlight python\"><table><tr><td class=\"gutter\"><pre><span class=\"line\">1</span><br><span class=\"line\">2</span><br><span class=\"line\">3</span><br><span class=\"line\">4</span><br><span class=\"line\">5</span><br><span class=\"line\">6</span><br><span class=\"line\">7</span><br><span class=\"line\">8</span><br><span class=\"line\">9</span><br><span class=\"line\">10</span><br><span class=\"line\">11</span><br></pre></td><td class=\"code\"><pre><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"keyword\">import</span> requests</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 创建 Session 对象</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">session = requests.Session()</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用 Session 对象发送请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = session.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/login&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br><span class=\"line\"><span class=\"comment\"># 使用相同的 Session 对象发送另一个请求</span></span><br><span class=\"line\">response = session.get(<span class=\"string\">&#x27;https://api.example.com/data&#x27;</span>)</span><br><span class=\"line\"></span><br></pre></td></tr></table></figure>\n<p>以上是关于 <code>requests</code> 库的一些基本知识点。使用这些知识，你可以方便地进行 HTTP 请求和处理服务器响应。</p>\n","categories":[{"name":"Web爬虫","path":"api/categories/Web爬虫.json"}],"tags":[]}